OL,3,GNEWSABus driver to walk 12 routes for
OL,4,Acharity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver who was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fcancer twice and hospitalised with
OL,8,FCovid-19 is walking all 12 of the
OL,9,Froutes which leave from his depot for
OL,10,Fcharity.
OL,12,FMark Jordison, 54, from Hebburn, South
OL,13,FTyneside, set himself the challenge of
OL,14,Fwalking more than 100 miles covered by
OL,15,Feach of the services operated by
OL,16,FStagecoach North East in Sunderland.
OL,18,FMany routes begin, or end, on Wearside
OL,19,Fbut some will finish in South Shields
OL,20,Fand Newcastle up to 14 miles (22.5km)
OL,21,Faway. He aims to complete one every
OL,22,FSaturday until 19 December.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
